ms","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Tours","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Hotels & Travel","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4ne0sDtVUZSNMW46VK_BMw","review_id":"JGJxo5thLKJjYIu5dhTCSA","date":"2016-03-25T16:38:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9522424340248108,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I arranged a private tour, and it was well-worth it! The staff were pro-actively communicative via email about scheduling. Our guide was super-knowledgeable and accommodating, clearly proud of his own history as a New Orleans native and descendant of free people of color. And we met one of the owners after our tour - this is clearly a passion project of all involved. Support this place by visiting!"},{"business_id":"4ne0sDtVUZSNMW46VK_BMw","review_id":"AesXZ6N8VCH9ihY7nqIcug","date":"2017-06-17T20:13:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9066582918167114,"text_excerpt":"Such an amazing experience!! I am from south Louisiana and still learned so much history. I would highly recommend you take the guided tour-you will gain so much more. The historian, Sarah was very well versed in the history and was able to answer our questions. Her tour helped clear up so many misconceptions about people of color in Louisiana and Louisiana history. She articulated the facts very well and referred several books during the tour(also on showcase). I HIGHLY recommend this tour to everyone, especially if you are African American. \"Until the lion writes the story, the tale will always glorify the hunter\" African proverb."},{"business_id":"4ne0sDtVUZSNMW46VK_BMw","review_id":"_nkSrscW_adKeUAFKgozGA","date":"2018-03-19T07:27:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9063949584960938,"text_excerpt":"Loved the tour and hearing about the history of free people of color which I had not heard before. I recommend making a stop here if you are visiting NOLA. Call ahead to get their tour times."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
